      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "RITZA SOPHIE (2) has a strong record this track and trip with eight wins and three placings from 12 starts. Comes off a (29.48) win last time, scoring by 7 lengths in a Grade 5 over 520m at this track. Appeals as a leading chance in this. CAWBOURNE ZARA (8) hit the ground running with a scorching early sectional but ran over late and missed the frame when a 1.5 lengths fourth (30.07) over 520m at Nowra. Solid beginner and with a good start should have clear running out wide. Has ability and can atone. MY CUPCAKE (1) turned in a plain run last time when fifth at this track over 520m behind Joanne (30.71) in a Grade 5. The form from her last run is stacking up nicely. Should be about the money. MAGGIE'S ETHICS (3) placed last time at this track and distance - worth some thought.",
